  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Data Analytics Training for Women and Youth</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The T4J activity will train women and youth on data analytics skills and enhance professional development to prepare job-seekers for roles at global employers and attract large international and regional employers to Jordan, especially those offering remote job opportunities at competitive wages. The T4J activity will recruit 6,000 qualified applicants for participation in the activity, including at least 3,000 women.</narrative>
  </description>
